{'question': 'Question Text: What number should replace the star?
Question Image: \begin{tabular}{rrrr}
\( 7 \) & \( 5 \) & \( 1 \) & \( 6 \) \\
\( -\quad 2 \) & \( 2 \) & \( 2 \) & \( 8 \) \\
\hline \( 5 \) & \( 2 \)
\end{tabular}
Answer A Text: \( 8 \)
Answer B Text: \( 3 \)
Answer C Text: \( 1 \)
Answer D Text: \( 0 \)'}

{'question': 'Question Text: Which calculation is correct to find the number of degrees representing comedy in a pie chart showing the following information? \begin{tabular}{|c|c|c|c|}
\hline Film Genre & Comedy & Romance & Action \\
\hline Number of teachers & \( 9 \) & \( 4 \) & \( 7 \) \\
\hline
\end{tabular}
Answer A Text: \( 360 \div 9 \)
Answer B Text: \( 360 \div 13 \times 9 \)
Answer C Text: \( 360 \div 9+4+7 \times 4 \)
Answer D Text: \( \frac{9}{9+7+4} \times 360 \)'}

{'question': 'Question Text: This is a table of values for \( 3 x+2 y=6 \) What should replace the star?
Question Image: \begin{tabular}{|l|l|l|l|l|l|}
\hline\( x \) & \( 0 \) & \( 1 \) & \( 2 \) & \( 3 \) & \( 4 \) \\
\hline\( y \) & & & & \multirow{2}{*}{}
\end{tabular}
Answer A Text: \( 1.5 \)
Answer B Text: \( 3 \)
Answer C Text: \( -1.5 \)
Answer D Text: \( -3 \)'}

{'question': 'Question Text: What is the constant of proportionality from a to \( b \) ? \begin{tabular}{|c|c|}
\hline \( \mathrm{a} \) & \( \mathrm{b} \) \\
\hline \( 6 \) & \( 2 \) \\
\hline \( 30 \) & \( 10 \) \\
\hline
\end{tabular}
Answer A Text: \( \frac{1}{3} \)
Answer B Text: \( 3 \)
Answer C Text: \( \frac{1}{5} \)
Answer D Text: \( 5 \)'}

